       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ACCTVAL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       COPY AUTHREQ.
       01 LK-VALID PIC X.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING AUTH-REQUEST LK-VALID.
           MOVE 'Y' TO LK-VALID
           IF AR-ACCOUNT-ID = SPACES
              MOVE 'N' TO LK-VALID
           END-IF
           GOBACK.
